#: ../../upstream/docs/user/canonical-urls.rst:2
msgid "Canonical URLs"
msgstr "规范 URL"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/canonical-urls.rst:4
msgid ""
"A `canonical URL`_ allows you to specify the preferred version of a web page"
" to prevent duplicated content. Here are some examples of when a canonical "
"URL is used:"
msgstr "`canonical URL`_ 允许你指定网页的首选版本，以防止内容重复。以下是使用规范 URL 的几种场景："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/canonical-urls.rst:8
msgid ""
"Search engines use your canonical URL to link users to the correct version "
"and domain of your documentation."
msgstr "搜索引擎使用你的规范 URL 将用户链接到正确版本和域名的文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/canonical-urls.rst:9
msgid ""
"Many popular chat clients and social media networks generate link previews, "
"using your canonical URL as the final destination."
msgstr "许多流行的聊天客户端和社交媒体网络会生成链接预览，使用你的规范 URL 作为最终目标。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/canonical-urls.rst:12
msgid ""
"If canonical URLs aren't used, it's easy for outdated documentation to be "
"the top search result for various pages in your documentation. This is not a"
" perfect solution for this problem, but generally people finding outdated "
"documentation is a big problem, and this is one of the suggested ways to "
"solve it from search engines."
msgstr ""
"如果不使用规范 "
"URL，文档中各页面很容易以过时内容作为搜索结果首条。这不是该问题的完美解决方案，但用户找到过时文档通常是个大问题，而这是搜索引擎建议的解决方式之一。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/canonical-urls.rst:21
msgid "How Read the Docs generates canonical URLs"
msgstr "Read the Docs 如何生成规范 URL"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/canonical-urls.rst:23
msgid "The canonical URL takes the following into account:"
msgstr "规范 URL 会考虑以下因素："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/canonical-urls.rst:25
msgid "The default version of your project (usually \"latest\" or \"stable\")."
msgstr "项目的默认版本（通常是 \"latest\" 或 \"stable\"）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/canonical-urls.rst:26
msgid ""
"The canonical :doc:`custom domain </custom-domains>` if you have one, "
"otherwise the default :ref:`subdomain <default-subdomain>` will be used."
msgstr ""
"若设置了规范 :doc:`自定义域名 </custom-domains>` 则使用它，否则使用默认 :ref:`子域名 <default-"
"subdomain>`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/canonical-urls.rst:29
msgid ""
"For example, if you have a project named ``example-docs`` with a custom "
"domain ``https://docs.example.com``, then your documentation will be served "
"at ``https://example-docs.readthedocs.io`` and ``https://docs.example.com``."
" Without specifying a canonical URL, a search engine like Google will index "
"both domains."
msgstr ""
"例如，若你有名为 ``example-docs`` 的项目并使用自定义域名 ``https://docs.example.com``，文档将同时在 "
"``https://example-docs.readthedocs.io`` 和 ``https://docs.example.com`` "
"提供服务。未指定规范 URL 时，Google 等搜索引擎会同时索引两个域名。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/canonical-urls.rst:34
msgid ""
"You'll want to use ``https://docs.example.com`` as your canonical domain. "
"This means that when Google indexes a page like ``https://example-"
"docs.readthedocs.io/en/latest/``, it will know that it should really point "
"at ``https://docs.example.com/en/latest/``, thus avoiding duplicating the "
"content."
msgstr ""
"你应将 ``https://docs.example.com`` 用作规范域名。这样当 Google 索引到 ``https://example-"
"docs.readthedocs.io/en/latest/`` 这样的页面时，就知道它实际应指向 "
"``https://docs.example.com/en/latest/``，从而避免内容重复。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/canonical-urls.rst:41
msgid ""
"If you want your custom domain to be set as the canonical, you need to set "
"``Canonical:  This domain is the primary one where the documentation is "
"served from`` in your project's :menuselection:`Settings --> Domains`."
msgstr ""
"若要将自定义域名设为规范域名，需在项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Domains` 中设置 ``Canonical:"
"  This domain is the primary one where the documentation is served from``。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/canonical-urls.rst:47
msgid "How to specify the canonical URL"
msgstr "如何指定规范 URL"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/canonical-urls.rst:49
msgid ""
"A canonical URL is automatically passed to the build process as "
"``READTHEDOCS_CANONICAL_URL`` :doc:`environment variable </reference"
"/environment-variables>`. You can use this variable to configure your "
"documentation tool to use it (eg. Sphinx does this via the ``html_baseurl`` "
"config, MkDocs via ``site_url`` and Pelican with ``SITEURL``)"
msgstr ""
"规范 URL 会自动作为 ``READTHEDOCS_CANONICAL_URL`` :doc:`环境变量 </reference"
"/environment-variables>` 传入构建过程。你可以用该变量配置文档工具使用它（例如 Sphinx 通过 "
"``html_baseurl`` 配置，MkDocs 通过 ``site_url``，Pelican 通过 ``SITEURL``）"

